{"4013130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Traces of Nyphs", "steam_appid": 4013130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013130/extras/f1aff46b11f53999423c04bf67e36f0f.avif?t=1780674098\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013130/extras_big/f1aff46b11f53999423c04bf67e36f0f.webp?t=1780674098 width=1560 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traces of Nyphs</strong> is a story-driven adventure about uncovering the quiet mysteries left behind after a magical disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Aiva</strong>, a mage sent to an isolated region where the flow of magic has collapsed. The land’s once-living energy was powered by a massive <strong>crystal core</strong>, now shattered and unstable. To restore balance, Aiva must explore the forgotten ruins, study ancient mechanisms, and discover how nature and magic once coexisted in harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she delves deeper into the valley, she begins to sense traces of the <strong>Nyphs</strong> — elusive beings once believed to be the guardians of the crystal’s power. Their presence lingers in the air, in the ruins, and perhaps, within Aiva herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013130/extras/f1aff46b11f53999423c04bf67e36f0f.avif?t=1780674098\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013130/extras_big/f1aff46b11f53999423c04bf67e36f0f.webp?t=1780674098 width=1560 height=152 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a mysterious valley</strong> filled with overgrown temples, mechanical relics, and secrets buried beneath the forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the mystery of the broken crystal core </strong>through environment and lore fragments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve atmospheric puzzles</strong> to reactivate old mechanisms and pathways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet and take care of Nyphs</strong>, magical creatures that evolve and help you navigate in the world in unexpected ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized 3D visuals</strong> with  a calm, immersive tone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013130/extras/62dbc7bb79a1e2769e9183dc381d4c9c.avif?t=1780674098\" width=1280 height=547 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013130/extras/f1aff46b11f53999423c04bf67e36f0f.avif?t=1780674098\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013130/extras_big/f1aff46b11f53999423c04bf67e36f0f.webp?t=1780674098 width=1560 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traces of Nyphs</strong> is a story-driven adventure about uncovering the quiet mysteries left behind after a magical disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Aiva</strong>, a mage sent to an isolated region where the flow of magic has collapsed. The land’s once-living energy was powered by a massive <strong>crystal core</strong>, now shattered and unstable. To restore balance, Aiva must explore the forgotten ruins, study ancient mechanisms, and discover how nature and magic once coexisted in harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she delves deeper 